forensic/gen/seed/ (copied into each built task) is taken from SAP-samples/datasphere-content (https://github.com/SAP-samples/datasphere-content),
commit 695af09278d8a57d0fb0a441f247060eaea5daf5:

  SAP_Sample_Content/CSV/HR/EmployeePersonalData.csv
  SAP_Sample_Content/CSV/FI/ProfitCenterTexts.csv
  Sample_Bikes_Sales_content/CSV/Products.csv
  Sample_Bikes_Sales_content/CSV/ProductTexts.csv
  Sample_Bikes_Sales_content/CSV/BusinessPartners.csv

